# Directory spec for the `kubectl-vynil` crate: the kubectl plugin CLI. Its sources are
# specified once they are drafted.

Spec: kubectl-vynil

Platform: Rust/Kubernetes

Purpose:
  Client-side `kubectl` plugin (`kubectl vynil …`). It drives the operator from the user's
  kubeconfig context: trigger scans and upgrades, pull diagnostics, and tail logs. It also
  hosts shell completion for the plugin.

Structure:
  ./src/main.rs: Entrypoint and `__complete`/completion dispatch
  ./src/lib.rs: Library root
  ./src/cli.rs: clap command tree and resource-kind constants
  ./src/actions.rs: Instance and JukeBox operations against the cluster
  ./src/bundle.rs: Diagnostic bundle pull and archive
  ./src/completion.rs: Dynamic `__complete` protocol handler
  ./src/items.rs: Resource listing and rendering
  ./src/transport.rs: HTTP transport to the diagnostic server
  ./kubectl_complete-vynil: Cobra-protocol shim invoked by kubectl
  ./completions/: Sourced completion scripts per shell

Owns:
  ./src/main.rs
  ./src/lib.rs
  ./src/cli.rs
  ./src/actions.rs
  ./src/bundle.rs
  ./src/completion.rs
  ./src/items.rs
  ./src/transport.rs
  ./Cargo.toml
  ./kubectl_complete-vynil
  ./completions/**

Must:
  Speak the Cobra `__complete` protocol so `kubectl vynil <TAB>` completes dynamically.
  Build statically-friendly with pure rustls so the released binary needs no libssl at runtime.
  Cross-compile for the release targets declared by the CI release job in
    `/.github/workflows/workflows.sdd`.

Must not:
  Reconcile or mutate package lifecycle beyond triggering an action the operator owns.
  Depend on `agent`, `operator`, or `server`.

Depends on:
  `kube`, `k8s-openapi`, `reqwest`, `clap`, `anyhow`

Done when:
  The actions, bundle, and completion modules have reviewed specs and `cargo test -p kubectl-vynil`
    is green.

Tasks:
  [ ] #0 Spec `./src/actions.rs`, `./src/bundle.rs`, and `./src/transport.rs`.
  [ ] #1 Spec `./src/completion.rs` and the shim.
